Acknowledgement of upstream work
-------------------------------
Genro Typst provides a Python authoring interface that generates Typst source.
The Typst language, typesetting engine and document compilation are the work
of Typst's authors and contributors, including Laurenz Mädje and Martin Haug.
We gratefully acknowledge the Typst team and its contributor community.

Typst project: https://typst.app/
Typst source and license: https://github.com/typst/typst

The optional PDF/SVG compilation feature uses Typst through its Python binding.
Genro Typst is an independent Softwell project, not an official Typst product
and not affiliated with or endorsed by Typst's authors.
